evidence/census/llm/patch/ (patch.diff, PR.md) contains changed hunks of simonw/llm
  (https://github.com/simonw/llm, commit aebaca2), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  Those hunks stay under their projects' licenses. The demo page (demo/static/data.js) shows the same hunks.
